---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { contatti } from '../dati';
import { linguaDi } from '../i18n';

const Titolo = Astro.props.h1 ? 'h1' : 'h2';
const l = linguaDi(Astro.url.pathname);

const crd = `apiVersion: apps.understudy.sh/v1alpha1
kind: Understudy
metadata:
  name: tenant-worker
spec:
  targetRef:
    kind: Deployment
    name: tenant-worker
  holdMode: always
  minSurgeTimeSeconds: 60
  readinessDeadlineSeconds: 600`;

const temaMitis = {
  name: 'mitis',
  type: 'dark',
  colors: {
    'editor.background': '#090d0b',
    'editor.foreground': '#e3e2dc',
  },
  tokenColors: [
    {
      scope: ['entity.name.tag', 'support.type.property-name', 'keyword'],
      settings: { foreground: '#53c287' },
    },
    { scope: ['string', 'string.unquoted'], settings: { foreground: '#e3e2dc' } },
    { scope: ['constant.numeric', 'constant.language'], settings: { foreground: '#f2f1ec', fontStyle: 'bold' } },
    { scope: ['punctuation'], settings: { foreground: '#7d857e' } },
    { scope: ['comment'], settings: { foreground: '#7d857e', fontStyle: 'italic' } },
  ],
};

const testi = {
  it: {
    eyebrow: 'kubernetes',
    titolo: 'Conosciamo Kubernetes da dentro.',
    praticaEyebrow: 'cosa vuol dire, in pratica',
    pratiche: [
      'operator e admission webhook scritti su misura, quando serve davvero',
      'upgrade di cluster senza finestre notturne né incroci di dita',
      'multi-tenancy con confini veri: namespace, quote, network policy, costi',
      'capacità e autoscaling accordati con Karpenter, spot compreso',
    ],
    proof:
      'Su un’interruzione spot reale, misurata su EKS, Understudy ha perso 1 richiesta su 764: meno di un normale rolling update.',
    restoPrima: 'Il resto dei numeri, con il loro contesto, è nel',
    readme: 'README',
    licenza: 'Apache 2.0 · Go · CRD e webhook di ammissione ·',
    repo: 'il repository',
  },
  en: {
    eyebrow: 'kubernetes',
    titolo: 'We know Kubernetes from the inside.',
    praticaEyebrow: 'what that means, in practice',
    pratiche: [
      'operators and admission webhooks written to measure, when it’s truly needed',
      'cluster upgrades without night-time windows or crossed fingers',
      'multi-tenancy with real boundaries: namespaces, quotas, network policies, costs',
      'capacity and autoscaling tuned with Karpenter, spot included',
    ],
    proof:
      'In a real spot interruption, measured on EKS, Understudy lost 1 request out of 764: less than an ordinary rolling update.',
    restoPrima: 'The rest of the numbers, with their context, is in the',
    readme: 'README',
    licenza: 'Apache 2.0 · Go · CRD and admission webhook ·',
    repo: 'the repository',
  },
}[l];
---

<Section id="kubernetes" eyebrow={testi.eyebrow} class="py-14 md:py-20">
  <Titolo class="max-w-[26ch] font-display text-h2 font-bold" data-rivela>
    {testi.titolo}
  </Titolo>
  <p class="mt-5 max-w-[64ch] text-body text-carta/75" data-rivela>
    {
      l === 'en' ? (
        <>
          Clusters, upgrades, multi-tenancy: routine work. The difference shows when the problem
          has no off-the-shelf solution: at that point we write the operator ourselves. It
          happened with{' '}
          <a
            href={contatti.understudy}
            class="font-semibold text-lichene underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline"
            >Understudy</a
          >, open source and Apache 2.0: it keeps single-replica workloads alive through drains,
          consolidations and spot interruptions, without paying for a second replica around the
          clock. It’s not the product: it’s the level we work at.
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Cluster, upgrade, multi-tenancy: ordinaria amministrazione. La differenza emerge quando
          il problema non ha una soluzione a scaffale: a quel punto l’operator lo scriviamo noi. È
          successo con{' '}
          <a
            href={contatti.understudy}
            class="font-semibold text-lichene underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline"
            >Understudy</a
          >, open source e Apache 2.0: tiene in vita i workload a replica singola attraverso
          drain, consolidamenti e interruzioni spot, senza pagare una seconda replica
          ventiquattr’ore al giorno. Non è il prodotto: è il livello a cui lavoriamo.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr]" data-rivela-serie>
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="font-mono text-label text-carta/60">{testi.praticaEyebrow}</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
        {
          testi.pratiche.map((v) => (
            <li class="flex gap-3 text-s text-carta/80">
              <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-mono font-bold text-lichene" aria-hidden="true">
                +
              </span>
              {v}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[54ch] border-l-4 border-lichene pl-4 text-l font-medium text-carta">
        {testi.proof}
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-s text-carta/60">
        {testi.restoPrima}{' '}
        <a
          href={contatti.understudy}
          class="text-lichene underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline">{testi.readme}</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="min-w-0">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] border border-carta/14 bg-schermo shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(83,194,135,0.07),0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 border-b border-carta/10 px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 shrink-0 bg-lichene" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.05em] text-carta/55">understudy.yaml</span>
        </div>
        <Code code={crd} lang="yaml" theme={temaMitis} class="crd-code" />
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-label text-carta/60">
        {testi.licenza}{' '}
        <a
          href={contatti.understudy}
          class="text-lichene underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline">{testi.repo}</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style is:global>
  .crd-code {
    background-color: var(--color-schermo) !important;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .crd-code code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
</style>
